file tools/caravan_ladder_reach_visibility_witness.rish slots advanced -- folded apprise_the_raiser, head redress_the_meeting, sibling weigh_the_answer
file crux/REMEMBER.md the live card's Now rows refreshed to this lap and the next crux named from the meter
recommend keep-going redress_the_meeting at sixteen identical bodies over seventeen declarations by forty-six lines -- 645 by realized fall, zero widening, the head the meter names. Open by reading which rung differs and why, exactly as this lap did; the split has come up three laps running and it has been meaning every time. Behind it weigh_the_answer at 624 over fourteen (fifteen declared), then confirm_pruned 516 over forty-four, seat_note 504 opening three, read_words 504 opening three, revoke_one 468 opening forty. elder_waits returns the same 504 while opening all forty-three, so it is the cheapest-looking row that costs the most. The ones that truly cost: choose_pass 630 opening 129, may_pass 574 opening 96, load_one 549 opening 120, read_own_line 492 opening 126. mend_the_plan is spent at 72.
